                                                                                
 Usage: opentide share status [OPTIONS]                                         
                                                                                
 Compare the local ledger with object versions. Does not contact the            
 destination.                                                                   
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --target        <str>  Destination block name. Repeatable.                   │
│ --uuid          <str>  Limit to these object UUIDs.                          │
│ --type          <str>  Limit to threat, objective, or rule.                  │
│ --file          <str>  Limit to these object files.                          │
│ --help                 Show this message and exit.                           │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide share status
